        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="8"><text:p>申請目的：□歷史考證　□學術研究　□事證稽憑　□業務參考　□權益保障</text:p><text:p>□其他（請敘明目的）：—</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
